#: ../../zh/triton_api/Scan_Sort_Ops/cumprod.md:5
msgid "简介：`triton.language.cumprod` 计算输入tensor沿指定轴的累积乘积，返回累积乘积结果。"
msgstr ""
"Description: `triton.language.cumprod` computes the cumulative product of "
"the input tensor along the specified axis, returning the cumulative product "
